 y}, f x < f y ↔ x < y) :\n    Preorder α where\n  le_refl _ := le.1 <| le_refl _\n  le_trans _ _ _ h₁ h₂ := le.1 <| le_trans (le.2 h₁) (le.2 h₂)\n  lt_iff_le_not_ge _ _ := by\n    rw [← le, ← le, ← lt, lt_iff_le_not_ge]","start":793,"end":802},"axioms":["propext"]}